{"seq":2,"slug":"pixels-and-sensitivity","title":"像素与感光能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/sensor-technology/pixels-and-sensitivity","wordCount":1790,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"像素与感光能力\">像素与感光能力</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>像素是图像传感器的最小感光单元。每个像素的物理结构——光电二极管面积、微透镜形状、色彩滤波器特性——直接决定了传感器的信噪比、分辨率与色彩精度。在&quot;像素大战&quot;的喧嚣背后，真正影响画质的是每个像素能收集多少光子、以多高的效率将其转化为有用信号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Incident Light&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Microlens&lt;br/&gt;微透镜&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Color Filter&lt;br/&gt;色彩滤波器&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Photodiode&lt;br/&gt;光电二极管&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Charge → Voltage&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;ADC → Digital&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Incident Light\"] --&gt; B[\"Microlens&lt;br/&gt;微透镜\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Color Filter&lt;br/&gt;色彩滤波器\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Photodiode&lt;br/&gt;光电二极管\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Charge → Voltage\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"ADC → Digital\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>像素是画质的最小构成单元，其物理结构直接决定性能上限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>像素截面</strong>：微透镜—色彩滤波器—光电二极管—传输门—浮动扩散节点—读出电路，逐层完成聚光、选色、光电转换与信号放大。</li>\n<li><strong>面积决定信噪比</strong>：满阱电荷容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FWC \\propto p^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随像素间距平方增长，进而决定动态范围与 SNR 上限。</li>\n<li><strong>色彩滤波阵列</strong>：Bayer 阵列以 1R+2G+1B 布局（绿色占 50%）承载亮度信息，去马赛克算法从原始数据还原全彩。</li>\n<li><strong>像素合并</strong>：将相邻 N×N 像素信号合并为等效大像素，用分辨率换取低光 SNR 提升。</li>\n<li><strong>聚光与对焦</strong>：微透镜把光线折向感光区，部分遮蔽的 PDAF 像素则实现片上相位检测自动对焦。</li>\n<li><strong>量子效率曲线</strong>：QE 是波长的函数，短波端受材料吸收限制、长波端受硅吸收系数限制，峰值通常在 500–600 nm。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"像素结构解剖\">像素结构解剖</h2><h3 id=\"单像素截面\">单像素截面</h3><p>一个典型的 BSI CMOS 像素从上到下包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>微透镜（Microlens）</td>\n<td>将光线聚焦到感光区</td>\n<td>曲率、折射率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩滤波器（CFA）</td>\n<td>只允许特定波段通过</td>\n<td>透过率、带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钝化层</td>\n<td>保护与光学间隔</td>\n<td>厚度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光电二极管（PD）</td>\n<td>光电转换</td>\n<td>深度、掺杂浓度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输门（TG）</td>\n<td>控制电荷转移</td>\n<td>开关电压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮动扩散节点（FD）</td>\n<td>电荷-电压转换</td>\n<td>电容值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读出电路</td>\n<td>放大与选择</td>\n<td>增益、噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"填充因子\">填充因子</h3><p>填充因子（Fill Factor）是有效感光面积占总像素面积的比例。理想值为 100%。影响因素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>像素间隙（死区）</li>\n<li>读出电路占用面积</li>\n<li>传输门面积</li>\n</ul>\n<p>BSI 技术将填充因子从 FSI 的 ~50% 提升至 ~80%，微透镜进一步将等效填充因子提升至接近 95%。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"像素尺寸与信噪比\">像素尺寸与信噪比</h2><h3 id=\"像素尺寸的物理意义\">像素尺寸的物理意义</h3><p>像素尺寸直接决定了其满阱电荷容量（Full Well Capacity, FWC）和信噪比上限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FWC \\propto A_{pixel} \\propto p^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为像素间距（Pixel Pitch）。典型值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传感器类型</th>\n<th>像素间距</th>\n<th>FWC</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手机主摄</td>\n<td>0.6–1.2 μm</td>\n<td>4,000–8,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>日常拍摄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手机合并后</td>\n<td>2.4 μm 等效</td>\n<td>32,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>四合一后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>APS-C</td>\n<td>3.7–4.2 μm</td>\n<td>30,000–50,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>消费相机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全画幅</td>\n<td>4.3–8.4 μm</td>\n<td>50,000–90,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>专业摄影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中画幅</td>\n<td>5.3–6.4 μm</td>\n<td>70,000–100,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>商业摄影</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"信噪比的物理极限\">信噪比的物理极限</h3><p>在光子散粒噪声主导的区域（中高亮度），像素 SNR：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SNR = \\frac{N_{signal}}{\\sqrt{N_{signal} + N_{dark} + N_{read}^2}} \\approx \\sqrt{N_{signal}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4903em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1777em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9323em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8923em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3077em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.3075em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9325em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8925em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3075em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>动态范围定义为满阱与噪底的比值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DR = 20\\log_{10}\\frac{FWC}{N_{read}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>读出噪声</th>\n<th>FWC</th>\n<th>动态范围</th>\n<th>等效档数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3 e⁻</td>\n<td>10,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>70.5 dB</td>\n<td>11.7 stops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.5 e⁻</td>\n<td>50,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>90.5 dB</td>\n<td>15.0 stops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 e⁻</td>\n<td>80,000 e⁻</td>\n<td>98.1 dB</td>\n<td>16.3 stops</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Pixel Size ↑&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;FWC ↑&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Light Collection ↑&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Dynamic Range ↑&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;SNR ↑&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Better Highlight/Shadow&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;Lower Noise&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Pixel Size ↑\"] --&gt; B[\"FWC ↑\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Light Collection ↑\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Dynamic Range ↑\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"SNR ↑\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Better Highlight/Shadow\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"Lower Noise\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"色彩滤波阵列\">色彩滤波阵列</h2><h3 id=\"bayer-阵列\">Bayer 阵列</h3><p>1976 年，Bryce Bayer 发明了至今最广泛使用的色彩滤波阵列：每 2×2 像素组包含 1R+2G+1B。绿色占 50% 是因为人眼对绿光最敏感，绿色通道承载了大部分亮度信息。</p>\n<p>去马赛克（Demosaicing）算法从 Bayer 原始数据还原出全彩色图像，常用方法包括双线性插值、AHD、AMaZE 等。去马赛克的质量直接影响细节保留与摩尔纹抑制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进阶-cfa-设计\">进阶 CFA 设计</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CFA 类型</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bayer</td>\n<td>RGGB 2×2</td>\n<td>成熟、兼容性好</td>\n<td>绝大多数传感器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quad-Bayer</td>\n<td>RGGB 4×4 相同色</td>\n<td>支持 4-in-1 合并</td>\n<td>Sony IMX586+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGBW</td>\n<td>加入白色像素</td>\n<td>低光灵敏度提升30%</td>\n<td>部分华为机型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X-Trans</td>\n<td>6×6 非周期阵列</td>\n<td>减少摩尔纹</td>\n<td>Fujifilm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Foveon</td>\n<td>三层堆叠 RGB</td>\n<td>每点全色，无去马赛克</td>\n<td>Sigma</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"像素合并-pixel-binning\">像素合并（Pixel Binning）</h3><p>Pixel Binning 将相邻 N×N 像素的信号合并为一个大像素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>4-in-1（Quad Bayer）：将 4 个同色像素合并，等效像素面积 4 倍</li>\n<li>9-in-1（Nona Bayer）：9 个像素合并，等效面积 9 倍</li>\n<li>16-in-1：新一代 2 亿像素传感器的合并模式</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合并模式</th>\n<th>原始像素</th>\n<th>合并后</th>\n<th>等效像素间距</th>\n<th>SNR 提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无合并</td>\n<td><a href=\"mailto:50mp@0.8\">50MP@0.8</a>μm</td>\n<td>50MP</td>\n<td>0.8 μm</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4-in-1</td>\n<td><a href=\"mailto:50mp@0.8\">50MP@0.8</a>μm</td>\n<td>12.5MP</td>\n<td>1.6 μm</td>\n<td>+6dB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9-in-1</td>\n<td><a href=\"mailto:108mp@0.7\">108MP@0.7</a>μm</td>\n<td>12MP</td>\n<td>2.1 μm</td>\n<td>+9.5dB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16-in-1</td>\n<td><a href=\"mailto:200mp@0.6\">200MP@0.6</a>μm</td>\n<td>12.5MP</td>\n<td>2.4 μm</td>\n<td>+12dB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"微透镜技术\">微透镜技术</h2><h3 id=\"聚光作用\">聚光作用</h3><p>微透镜（On-Chip Microlens）位于每个像素正上方，将入射到非感光区的光线折向光电二极管中心。没有微透镜的像素，大量落在间隙和电路区域的光子将被浪费。</p>\n<p>微透镜设计的关键参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>焦距</strong>：需要精确匹配像素深度</li>\n<li><strong>间隙</strong>：相邻微透镜之间的间隙（Gap-less 设计追求零间隙）</li>\n<li><strong>偏移</strong>：边缘像素的微透镜需要向中心偏移（CRA 匹配）以适应主光线角度</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"相位检测自动对焦-pdaf-像素\">相位检测自动对焦（PDAF）像素</h3><p>部分像素的微透镜被遮蔽一半，只接收来自透镜左半或右半的光线。通过比较左右 PDAF 像素的信号差异，相机可以计算散焦量和方向——这就是片上相位检测 AF 的原理。</p>\n<p>现代全像素双核 PDAF（Dual Pixel AF）将每个像素分为左右两个子光电二极管，在不牺牲分辨率的情况下实现全画面相位对焦。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"量子效率深度分析\">量子效率深度分析</h2><p>量子效率（QE）是波长的函数，其曲线形状取决于：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>短波端截止</strong>：受微透镜/CFA 材料吸收和光电二极管浅层复合影响</li>\n<li><strong>长波端截止</strong>：硅的吸收系数随波长增大而减小，深红/近红外需更深的光电二极管</li>\n<li><strong>峰值位置</strong>：BSI 传感器峰值通常在 500–600 nm</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实际应用意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>QE 高 → 同等曝光下信号更强 → 噪声更低</li>\n<li>QE 曲线平坦 → 色彩一致性好</li>\n<li>红外响应 → 需要 IR-cut 滤镜（否则色彩偏暖）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>像素是传感器画质的最小构成单元。从物理面积决定的信噪比上限，到色彩滤波阵列的设计哲学，再到微透镜的聚光优化，每一个工程决策都在分辨率、噪声、动态范围之间做出取舍。理解这些权衡，你就能看穿&quot;亿级像素&quot;的营销噱头，关注真正决定画质的核心指标——像素尺寸、满阱电荷与读出噪声。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"像素与感光能力","id":"像素与感光能力"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"像素结构解剖","id":"像素结构解剖"},{"level":3,"text":"单像素截面","id":"单像素截面"},{"level":3,"text":"填充因子","id":"填充因子"},{"level":2,"text":"像素尺寸与信噪比","id":"像素尺寸与信噪比"},{"level":3,"text":"像素尺寸的物理意义","id":"像素尺寸的物理意义"},{"level":3,"text":"信噪比的物理极限","id":"信噪比的物理极限"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩滤波阵列","id":"色彩滤波阵列"},{"level":3,"text":"Bayer 阵列","id":"bayer-阵列"},{"level":3,"text":"进阶 CFA 设计","id":"进阶-cfa-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"像素合并（Pixel Binning）","id":"像素合并-pixel-binning"},{"level":2,"text":"微透镜技术","id":"微透镜技术"},{"level":3,"text":"聚光作用","id":"聚光作用"},{"level":3,"text":"相位检测自动对焦（PDAF）像素","id":"相位检测自动对焦-pdaf-像素"},{"level":2,"text":"量子效率深度分析","id":"量子效率深度分析"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CMOS 与 CCD 传感器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/sensor-technology/cmos-ccd-sensors"},"next":{"title":"传感器性能指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/sensor-technology/sensor-performance-metrics"}}